{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:706","content":{"id":706,"title":"旋转链表","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"37d3d8bb-2e35-41cb-aa18-bc54f47e4f32","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e4a31023-d9ee-4343-a3a1-fa50d7072a63","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给你一个链表的头节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"head"},{"type":"formatted","text":" ，旋转链表，将链表每个节点向右移动 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"k"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个位置。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"827b01eb-3a81-4118-944e-c68fccd6698a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例1："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"809d202f-541e-46ec-9f6c-2a71c6d77c75","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"44b86843-7a7e-45aa-8788-02ba06b067ff","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：head = [1,2,3,4,5], k = 2\n输出：[4,5,1,2,3]","collabId":"4a478094-9c90-409e-9fcd-a74f6b177ea6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"897704d2-b914-4809-a5b5-92afedbf2489","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例2："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"3eec04ca-c5bb-4829-ac23-4ac360e1ec12","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6e3306de-6921-4500-8844-529da05b73a2","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：head = [0,1,2], k = 4\n输出：[2,0,1]","collabId":"ed1ef4b4-f35d-4a96-8323-49b618bdc44a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4a18f0cb-80be-45c3-aefe-7af0f0c432cd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"提示："},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"0 \\leq k \\leq 2 \\times 10^9","collabId":"a5046281-93c4-47a0-806d-07dbf85a983f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0 \\leq k \\leq 2 \\times 10^9"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"ffb2e1b7-b24d-4756-a632-aebaed2f011c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_08356a0d-9090-4974-9f0d-190160b9a8a5.webp","uuid":"b043f305-d5e0-414b-9408-0975e566c8d1","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_08356a0d-9090-4974-9f0d-190160b9a8a5.webp","width":377.0833183493885,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"73bb6246-6e88-4624-84a5-105a34f16066","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bec780a3-f813-4032-87f6-eb9032dbf165","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"k"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的大小可能大于链表的长度，所以我们首先需求求得链表的长度 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"l"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，接着将 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"k"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 映射到 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"[0, l)","collabId":"0f300be5-82b9-4d27-92ad-351a1fd1638d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"[0, l)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之间，顺便获得链表的最后一个节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"end"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_4d170e8c-630a-4c5b-b854-24488a246245.webp","uuid":"c65442f0-34d9-4d4c-99cc-291967bbf239","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_4d170e8c-630a-4c5b-b854-24488a246245.webp","width":449.99998211860725,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"9940862a-a003-41d1-8b3b-1860da34fd50","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d17b2a86-6010-4d72-9e2e-714f06bc0015","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这时我们可以知道旋转后的根节点在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"l - k"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 处， 遍历链表获得根节点的前一个节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"pre"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 以及返回的根节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"root"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_fb0607cc-36f7-433c-8571-fc70e047ea55.webp","uuid":"da715af6-3113-4e47-a780-3395b5eefb52","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_fb0607cc-36f7-433c-8571-fc70e047ea55.webp","width":385.41665135158496,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"33a5d681-b9bf-499d-8c82-bb9179eb4d13","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"71baa451-4d54-4c99-8e3f-21af9f6f156a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"9c1743e5-4230-4896-b2e3-9c89f5463f87","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public ListNode rotateRight(ListNode head, int k) {\n    if (head == null || k == 0) {\n        return head;\n    }\n\n    // 统计链表长度，以及找到最后一个节点\n    ListNode cur = head;\n    int l = 1;\n    while (cur.next != null) {\n        l++;\n        cur = cur.next;\n    }\n    ListNode end = cur;\n\n    k = k % l + 1;\n    if (k == 0) {\n        return head;\n    }\n\n    // 找到返回的根节点的前一个节点\n    cur = head;\n    for (int i = 1; i < l - k; i++) {\n        cur = cur.next;\n    }\n    ListNode root = cur.next;\n\n    cur.next = null;\n    end.next = head;\n\n    return root;\n}","collabId":"a8f92903-8943-40de-b421-2e6b146ef5e1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"fe18c776-eebc-4086-b06a-5843d9626da0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"b4f4194d-4bac-4123-a09b-84f8a3bcb7c7","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f2471772-4ba9-4e0c-8b49-1f525c3cda45","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d845ee13-f272-403c-9c19-7bfcfcbe2827","children":[{"type":"link","url":"旋转链表","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"3e6a2b00-8954-4085-be17-a0d4aeaeba0f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"旋转链表"}]}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"链表"},{"label":"旋转链表","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:706","type":"doc","id":706}}],"prevPage":{"title":"删除排序链表中的重复元素II","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:700","type":"doc","id":700}},"nextPage":{"title":"合并 K 个升序链表","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:692","type":"doc","id":692}},"createTime":1729001899879,"updateTime":1775928750073,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1775928750073}}